# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale nl
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [12:00, 18:00).
# "vanmiddag" is the single-word today+middag surface, the sibling of
# "vanochtend" and "vanavond".  Wiktionary, "vanmiddag": "this afternoon, the
# afternoon of the current day"; Wikiwoordenboek: "tijdens de middag van de
# lopende dag".  The bare "middag" stays the noon landmark of
# clock_landmark_720.voc, so only the fused word is listed here.
vanmiddag
